#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:78
#: 0d216f09027544559f6f66e7c404d6cc
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:80
#: fa860edb616946d596216f118d7453f2
msgid "The R6 pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:82
#: 97fbb7c9bf3b48f1b31f08a507110727
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers, the R6 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART RX pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL6 port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:84
#: d965e7a9f6224ec49e62fb55441e16fa
msgid "With this option, :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` must be set to \"23\", and:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:86
#: f5239d8a7d084deeb823f17e3c41509b
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:88
#: d19ceff2a8ed44328ff1f1a211c55450
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin, but SBUS requires that the :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:90
#: bc1e9ab558134be7905d2242a1a96e97
msgid "FPort requires connection to T6 and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"7\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:92
#: 69917e0ee4f44f219dcef510751ab12e
msgid "CRSF also requires a T6 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:94
#: d5530b1c09ee4cf6a27c273e12f90f1e
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to T6 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:96
#: 86c59cd0a8ea4f1eb368d6edb2049be7
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:99
#: da4f7c34b52246b7a4c47404594f2dfb
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:101
#: ae78485835064ef7ba66b28984282f1c
msgid "FrSky Telemetry is supported using the Tx pin of any UART including SERIAL6/UART6 . You need to set the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT (example shows SERIAL6). Note this assumes the RC input is using default (:ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 0). Obviously, if using :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 for full duplex RC prtocols, you must a different UART for FrSky Telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7.rst:103
#: cc62d7c5801b47c18d812ef7296fc8be
